# ---- Other authors' published papers: on disk, never tracked ----
# This repository is public. The two citation libraries hold published PDFs
# whose copyright belongs to their authors and publishers, so they live here
# for reading and stay out of git. Everything WE wrote is tracked: the
# manuscript, supplement, TRIPOD+AI checklist, cover letter, the reserve and
# review documents, the library indexes (README.md, CITATION_MAP.md), the
# role-grouped manifests, the reprint-request drafts, and the SFHS data
# provenance note. A clone therefore arrives with the bibliography described
# but not carried; CITATION_MAP.md says what each missing prefix is.
paper1-trd-prediction/references/*.pdf
paper2-counterfactual/references/*.pdf
paper2-counterfactual/references/*_SUPPL-APPENDIX.docx
paper2-counterfactual/references/*_METHODS-SUPPLEMENT.docx

# The TRIPOD+AI reporting guideline is Collins et al. 2024 (BMJ) -- someone
# else's paper. The JMIR submission template is ours to use and is tracked.
formats/TripodAI.pdf
